    <div>
      <p begin="00:18.080" end="00:21.950" ttm:agent="v1">I know you want me baby</p>
      <p begin="00:21.950" end="00:26.330" ttm:agent="v1">Think about you all the time on the daily</p>
      <p begin="00:26.330" end="00:30.170" ttm:agent="v1">You make my mind go crazy</p>
      <p begin="00:30.170" end="00:34.280" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, I won't waste your time, please don't play me</p>
      <p begin="00:34.280" end="00:38.150" ttm:agent="v1">I know you want me baby</p>
      <p begin="00:38.150" end="00:41.660" ttm:agent="v1">Think about you all the time on the daily</p>
