      <p begin="00:46.060" end="00:50.050" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, I won't waste your time, please don't play me</p>
      <p begin="00:50.050" end="00:53.960" ttm:agent="v1">Looking at your pretty face while the sun sets</p>
      <p begin="00:53.960" end="00:58.320" ttm:agent="v1">I don't ever wanna make you upset</p>
      <p begin="00:58.320" end="01:01.990" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, don't you leave, I'm not done yet</p>
      <p begin="01:01.990" end="01:06.030" ttm:agent="v1">We be dancing in the rain while we undress</p>
